        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "The ageing of the population is synonymous with multiple pathologies and polypharmacy, which increases risk factors. François-Tosquelles general hospital carried out a study into the administering of medicines within the ageing population in psychiatry and drew up an assessment of professional practices with regard to polypharmacy in geriatric psychiatry."
